.TH CRUNCH_GET_KERNEL_SYMS 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_get_kernel_syms \- invokes obsolete get_kernel_syms syscall 177, unimplemented on linux x86-64 and returning enosys
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/module.h>
.B int crunch_get_kernel_syms(void* symbols);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes obsolete get_kernel_syms syscall 177, unimplemented on Linux x86-64 and returning ENOSYS.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR get_kernel_syms (2)
